<title>UK: Caisse Centrale Desjardins plans C$ FRN - BZW.</title>
<headline>Caisse Centrale Desjardins plans C$ FRN - BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caisse Centrale Desjardins plans to launch a Canadian dollar FRN on Tuesday, lead manager BZW said.</p>
<p>The deal's maturity will be five years. No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
